	measure 'PPV Savings' = ```
			
			SUMX (
			    FILTER (
			        VALUES ( po_fact_table[item_name_mpn] ),
			        NOT ISBLANK (
			            CALCULATE (
			                [Avg Unit Cost],
			                DATEADD ( 'Time Intelligence'[Date], -1, YEAR )
			            )
			        )
			            && [Total Quantity] > 0
			    ),
			    VAR CurrentPrice = [Avg Unit Cost]
			    VAR PriorPrice =
			        CALCULATE (
			            [Avg Unit Cost],
			            DATEADD ( 'Time Intelligence'[Date], -1, YEAR )
			        )
			    VAR CurrentQty = [Total Quantity]
			    RETURN
			        ( PriorPrice - CurrentPrice ) * CurrentQty
			)
			
			```
		formatString: \$#,0;(\$#,0);\$#,0
		displayFolder: 02 - Time Intelligence
		lineageTag: f270a989-7b02-4c6d-ae3f-2g4b5c6d8e9f

